 open:"Elder Kang descends the dais slowly. \u201CForty years I have fed the furnace foreign souls. Yours burns brightest of all.\u201D",
 p2text:"Kang tears open his robe. A furnace door of black iron is grafted where his heart should be, and it is OPEN.",
 moves:[{n:"Furnace palm",d:6},{n:"Chain-seal whip",d:5,drain:1},{n:"Soul-Harvest Seal",kind:"charge",text:"Kang folds his hands. Grave-cold sigils ignite around your soul.",tele:"The Soul-Harvest Seal is forming. Break it or pay."},{n:"Soul Harvest",d:11,drain:2,kind:"release"}],
